EnsureApprovedTest
├── when the token returns nothing from approve
│ └── it treats the call as a success and the add completes
├── when the token reverts on approve toward Permit2
│ ├── it skips that call and still grants the Permit2 allowances
│ └── given the token is already wired
│     └── it never touches approve again
├── when the ERC20 allowance toward Permit2 has degraded
│ └── it re-approves zero-first and heals back to max
└── when the key smuggles native in as currency1
    └── it reverts and unwinds atomically
